# Transportation Safety Monitoring System

## 📌 Overview
A real-time monitoring system that analyzes transportation data to detect hazards using Python, data cleaning, and alert automation.

## 🧰 Tech Stack
- Python (Pandas)
- CSV data processing
- Automated alert system

## ⚙️ Features
- Detect overspeeding
- Detect high engine temperatures
- Generate safety alerts
- Data cleaning & preprocessing
